      "extract": "In this paper we have analysed a number of gedanken experiments to illustrate the consistency of the following two hypotheses: 1) To an outside observer all information falling onto a black hole is stored and ther- malized on the stretched horizon until it is radiated during evaporation. The thermalization involves processes which wash out baryon number. 2) To an infalling observer no exceptional phenomenon such as",
